 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Level 2 (inferred) generalises the delay: the first delay calls return \"PENDING\" and call j (1-based, j > delay) returns feedback about the guess of call j - delay. Strategy: binary search with lo = 1, hi = upperBound; each round sets mid = floor((lo + hi) / 2) and calls check(mid) delay + 1 times; the last answer is the feedback on that round's first call. Stop on \"CORRECT\". Return [found secret, total number of check calls].",
  "provenance": [
